Talk to me about Ms. Lange,

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.075
what was it like working with her?

00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:31.908
- A dream.

00:00:31.908 --> 00:00:34.600
- Don't eat that fast.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.000
You're going to yack it
all up like a baby bird.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.710
Spit it out.

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.490
Oh, Christ, look at that.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.323
Jesus.

00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:44.570
- I love her so much and
it was such a rewarding

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.750
and special experience working with her,

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.880
and I was just doing my best to be as much

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.730
